{"stem_en": "For real x: (i) |x| = x if x ≥ 0 (ii) |x| = −x if x ≤ 0 (iii) |x + y| = |x| + |y|. Which is correct?", "stem_bn": "বাস্তব সংখ্যার ক্ষেত্রে: (i) x ≥ 0 হলে |x| = x (ii) x ≤ 0 হলে |x| = −x (iii) |x + y| = |x| + |y| — কোনটি সঠিক?", "option_a_en": "i and ii only", "option_a_bn": "শুধু i ও ii", "option_b_en": "i and iii only", "option_b_bn": "শুধু i ও iii", "option_c_en": "ii and iii only", "option_c_bn": "শুধু ii ও iii", "option_d_en": "i, ii and iii", "option_d_bn": "i, ii ও iii", "correct": "A", "difficulty": "easy", "type": "conceptual", "explanation_en": "(iii) is false in general; |x + y| ≤ |x| + |y|.", "explanation_bn": "(iii) সাধারণত মিথ্যা; |x + y| ≤ |x| + |y|।", "verified": false, "source": "Udvash HSC Question Bank 2026; licensed redistribution; higher_mathematics p2 ch01; curated bilingual"}
