{"stem_en": "For real p, q: (i) |p + q| ≤ |p| + |q| (ii) |pq| = |p| |q| (iii) |p − q| ≤ ||p| − |q||. Which is correct?", "stem_bn": "বাস্তব p, q এর ক্ষেত্রে: (i) |p + q| ≤ |p| + |q| (ii) |pq| = |p| |q| (iii) |p − q| ≤ ||p| − |q|| — কোনটি সঠিক?", "option_a_en": "i and ii only", "option_a_bn": "শুধু i ও ii", "option_b_en": "i and iii only", "option_b_bn": "শুধু i ও iii", "option_c_en": "ii and iii only", "option_c_bn": "শুধু ii ও iii", "option_d_en": "i, ii and iii", "option_d_bn": "i, ii ও iii", "correct": "A", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "conceptual", "explanation_en": "(iii) is false; the reverse triangle inequality is |p − q| ≥ ||p| − |q||.", "explanation_bn": "(iii) মিথ্যা; সঠিক হলো |p − q| ≥ ||p| − |q||।", "verified": false, "source": "Udvash HSC Question Bank 2026; licensed redistribution; higher_mathematics p2 ch01; curated bilingual"}
